{"id":"taiwan-permit-guide","question":"台胞證怎麼辦？","answer":"新中旅快簽提供台胞證首次申辦、換發、遺失補辦與急件評估。先確認案件類型、文件與出發日期，再選擇適合的門市。","sources":["https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/","https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#documents-summary"],"provider":"新中旅快簽 YesVisa","canonical_service":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/","canonical_service_id":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#service","dataset_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","documents_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#documents-summary","fees_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#price-summary","citation_updated_at":"2026-11-07","source_relationship":"first_party_business_information","language":"zh-TW"}
{"id":"taiwan-permit-fees","question":"台胞證代辦費用怎麼看？","answer":"新中旅快簽的費用依首次申辦、換發、遺失及所選時效區分。請查看官網最新台胞證費用表，再由門市確認適用資格與受理條件。","sources":["https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#price-summary","https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/"],"provider":"新中旅快簽 YesVisa","canonical_service":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/","canonical_service_id":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#service","dataset_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","documents_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#documents-summary","fees_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#price-summary","citation_updated_at":"2026-11-07","source_relationship":"first_party_business_information","language":"zh-TW"}
{"id":"taipei-metro-branches","question":"搭台北捷運去哪裡辦台胞證？","answer":"可使用新中旅快簽109站查詢，依出發站比較中山與松江南京兩家門市；此索引為該品牌兩店的到店指引，並非全市場評比。","sources":["https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","https://yesvisa.org/chain-store/zhongshan/","https://yesvisa.org/chain-store/songjiangnanjing/","https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/"],"provider":"新中旅快簽 YesVisa","canonical_service":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/","canonical_service_id":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#service","dataset_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","documents_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#documents-summary","fees_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#price-summary","citation_updated_at":"2026-11-07","source_relationship":"first_party_business_information","language":"zh-TW"}
{"id":"fuzhong-route","question":"從府中站去新中旅快簽辦台胞證怎麼走？","answer":"依資料集路徑，府中出發可搭板南線至西門，轉松山新店線往松山方向至中山，拓樸估算7站、轉乘1次，再由中山站5號出口旁前往台北中山門市；站數不是保證車程。申請文件與費用請查看官網核心服務頁。","sources":["https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","https://yesvisa.org/chain-store/zhongshan/","https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#documents-summary","https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#price-summary"],"provider":"新中旅快簽 YesVisa","canonical_service":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/","canonical_service_id":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#service","dataset_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","documents_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#documents-summary","fees_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#price-summary","citation_updated_at":"2026-11-07","source_relationship":"first_party_business_information","language":"zh-TW"}
{"id":"orange-route","question":"中和永和怎麼搭捷運到新中旅快簽？","answer":"南勢角、景安、永安市場與頂溪可搭中和新蘆線往蘆洲或迴龍方向直達松江南京；4號出口約50公尺，地面步行約1–2分鐘為估算，不含站內及上樓時間。環狀線中和站Y12須先在景安轉橘線。","sources":["https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/#zhonghe-xinlu-line","https://yesvisa.org/chain-store/songjiangnanjing/","https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/"],"provider":"新中旅快簽 YesVisa","canonical_service":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/","canonical_service_id":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#service","dataset_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","documents_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#documents-summary","fees_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#price-summary","citation_updated_at":"2026-11-07","source_relationship":"first_party_business_information","language":"zh-TW"}
{"id":"urgent-assessment","question":"搭捷運到新中旅快簽可以辦台胞證急件嗎？","answer":"可先確認文件與出發日期並詢問急件評估。1天、2天件原則上請於工作日上午11:00前到店，文件與當日受理條件由門市確認；12小時件另依資格、文件與當日服務量個案評估，不保證受理、完成或核發。","sources":["https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/urgent/","https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/"],"provider":"新中旅快簽 YesVisa","canonical_service":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/","canonical_service_id":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#service","dataset_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taipei-metro-taiwan-compatriot-permit-routing/","documents_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#documents-summary","fees_url":"https://yesvisa.org/taiwan-compatriot-permit/#price-summary","citation_updated_at":"2026-11-07","source_relationship":"first_party_business_information","language":"zh-TW"}
